      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDariyu inkosi wasemisa umthetho ukuba kuhlolisiswe eBabiloni endlini yokugcinela impahla lapho kwakubekwe khona izincwadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "KwakuseAkibatana emzini omkhulu wenkosi, elizweni lamaMede, okwafunyaniswa khona incwadi okwakulotshiwe kiyo ukuthi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngomnyaka wokuqala wokubusa kukaKurosi wakhupha lumthetho mayelana lendlu kaNkulunkulu eseJerusalema wathi: Kakwakhiwe futhi lindlu lapho kuzanikelwa khona iminikelo, kulethwe leminikelo yokutshiswa; ukuphakama kwayo kube zingalo ezingamatshumi ayisithupha, lobubanzi bayo bube zingalo ezingamatshumi ayisithupha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "umduli wayo ube lemizila emithathu yamatshe amakhulu lomzila owodwa wezigodo. Izindleko zokwakha kazihlawulwe ngemali yesikhwama senkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lezitsha zegolide lezesiliva zendlu kaNkulunkulu uNebukadineza azithatha ethempelini eliseJerusalema waziletha eBabiloni, kazibuyiselwe ethempelini eliseJerusalema, zonke endaweni zazo, zibekwe endlini kaNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uDariyu yasikhupha lumthetho yathi: Ngakhoke, wena Tathenayi, mbusi welizwe elingaphetsheya komfula iYufrathi, lawe Shethari‐Bozenayi, lalabo elilabo, ababusi abaselizweni elingaphetsheya kweYufrathi, lingasondeli kuleyondawo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uyekeleni umsebenzi walindlu kaNkulunkulu uqhubeke; liyekele umbusi wabaJuda labadala babo bazakhele futhi lindlu kaNkulunkulu endaweni yayo yokuqala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi ngiyamisa umthetho mayelana lalokho elifanele ukubenzela khona lababadala babaJuda ekwakhiweni kwalindlu kaNkulunkulu. Indleko zabo kazihlawulwe zonke ngemfanelo ngemali evela esikhwameni senkosi eyemithelo yelizwe elingaphetsheya komfula iYufrathi, ukuze umsebenzi uqhubeke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Loba kuyini okuswelekayo, izinkunzi lezinqama, loba amawundlu omnikelo wokutshiselwa uNkulunkulu ophezulu, amabele letshwayi lewayini lamafutha njengokufunwa ngabapristi eJerusalema kabakunikwe konke insuku ngensuku kungaphuthi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukuze banikele iminikelo ethokozisayo kuNkulunkulu ophezulu, bakhulekele inkosi lamadodana ayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi ngiyamisa umthetho wokuthi lowo odiliza lesisimemezelo kakuhwatshwe uthungo endlini yakhe, lugxunyelwe ajujwe ngalo; lendlu yakhe yenziwe iquba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu obizo lakhe lizadunyiselwa kuleyondawo achithe inkosi loba abantu abaguqula lokhu, badilize lendlu kaNkulunkulu eseJerusalema. Mina Dariyu, ngiyakumisa lokhu, kakwenziwe konke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
